# Spec-pipeline scratch: the Stryker report directory only.
#
# `runs.jsonl` is deliberately NOT ignored here. It is the append-only telemetry log —
# `.standards/scripts/record-gate-run.sh` appends one JSON object per line to it, and
# `.standards/scripts/gate-stats.sh` reads it from the repo root. It is tracked in git on
# purpose: the trend is the point, and it has to survive merges.
reports/
